                      "markup": "<p>MCP (Model Control Protocol) is revolutionizing how we interact with language models. It enables seamless integration between AI systems and tools, making them work together harmoniously.</p><p>With MCP, developers can create more sophisticated applications that leverage the power of multiple AI systems in concert, without the usual integration headaches.</p>",
